	(text "Totals: all 14 module GPIOs used (10 GPIO + USART2 on PA2 / PA3) + I2C1 + VCP UART + SWD + NRST; CAN transceiver on the module; USB not connected.\nFunction colours as on the MES4-MCU U1 pin map. Yellow MES4-CIF §2c cells: this board differs from the standard (no relay coil feedback, so PA0 / PA1 = winch, PA2 / PA3 = servo UART).\nChecked against the MES4-MCU netlist on 2026-10-27: every finger carries the same signal on both boards, and every GPIO finger goes straight to the STM32G0B1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 24.13 135.73 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "3ac45a27-c201-56a9-8410-d01d17501579")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
